// spec: a nameless enum would be scoped as every kpp enum is, its enumerators never named: an error naming what to write instead (design.md 8.4); a [[c]] one keeps C's rules
// error: nameless_enum_is_error.kpp:3: error: a nameless enum is scoped as every kpp enum is, so its enumerators could never be named
enum { Size = 4 };
[[c]] enum { Count = 2 };
int main()
{
  return Count;
}
